Body:
Friendly ping — this PR adds iFlow Search as an MCP server example to the docs page. It's a single-file, docs-only change under `packages/web/` and follows the existing MCP server example format.

@jayair — it looks like you've been the recent steward of `mcp-servers.mdx`; would you have a moment to take a look when you have bandwidth?

Happy to rebase or adjust formatting if anything doesn't match the page's conventions.

@muhmd-sinan Just tested an works perfectly for me in the `ap-south-1` region.

<img width="1913" height="1124" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32c04c4b-fb4f-4db3-8586-a98c31aa555f" />

Can you confirm you have the right region set in your envars.

@mortenbj-statnett you need to find where that VAR is and fix from there, cause your fixes don't seem to be permanent. Maybe go ahead and unset the VAR completely then set it up again.

```bash
unset OPENCODE_CONFIG_CONTENT

export OPENCODE_CONFIG_CONTENT={}
```
